    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Time to combine everything in one line:\n\n4848 ÷ 24 × 11 − 222\n\n÷ and × first, left to right:\n\n4848 ÷ 24 = 202\n202 × 11 = 2222\n\nNow the subtraction:\n\n2222 − 222 = 2000",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_4_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_4_step": {
      "id": "teach_4_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Notice the shape of the work:\n\n1. Scan for brackets and 'of' — none here.\n2. Do ÷ and × left to right.\n3. Do + and − last.\n\nWrite one step per line. Each line should change only one thing.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
      ]
    },
