      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Think of −2508 + 221 on a number line.\n\nStart at −2508, move 221 steps right.\nYou land at −2287, still left of zero.\n\nA negative answer is fine. Never flip the sign just to make it look nicer.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
